@Christine, I quite agree that that PDF icon is ridiculously too small. Here is a pure CSS solution, tested with the default Boost theme. Go to your site's Administration->Appearance->Current theme Advanced Settings and put these CSS rules in it: 
```text
#page-mod-questionnaire-report .icon[alt="Download PDF"] {


  max-height: 40px;


  max-width: 40px; 


  height: 40px;


  width: 40px; 


  padding-bottom: 14px;


}


#page-mod-questionnaire-report .fa-print {


  font-size: 30px;


}
```
 The second rule also makes the printer icon bigger. You can change those px values if you prefer not so much larger sizes. Here's what it looks like, before making those CSS changes and after: ``

